# Build context exclusions for `build/Dockerfile.test` only — BuildKit reads
# `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` in preference to the root `.dockerignore`, which is what lets the ISO
# tier keep the one directory the test tier must not carry.
#
# `build/inputs/` is 317 MB of archived `.apk` files, a minirootfs and a kernel tarball. The ISO
# build needs every byte of it; the test tier needs none of it, and `COPY . /src` would otherwise
# bake it into the harness image.
build/inputs
out
.git
.hypothesis
**/__pycache__
